      "snippet": "Our findings demonstrate that D. discoideum cells co-aggregate more with genetically similar than dissimilar individuals",
      "words": 15,
      "source": {
        "path": "/tmp/traitmech-kin-discrimination-canary-20261013/ostrowski2008-html.response",
        "url": "https://journals.plos.org/plosbiology/article?id=10.1371/journal.pbio.0060287",
